N:HOW READ (2026-11-10): the clip's audio (4 min 8 s) was pitch-tracked with the steady drone subtracted; the drone is B (247.6 Hz, B3 at A=440, 5 cents sharp). The performance plays the tune twice (0:02-2:11 and 2:13-4:03); both passes agree on the notes, and the second, cleaner one decided the few disagreements. Each phrase takes about 12 seconds, so at 1/4=60 each phrase is three bars here.
N:INTONATION, in cents from equal temperament against the drone: C sharp +14, D -8, E +5, F sharp +13, G -35 to -50.
N:UNCERTAIN: the ornaments (quick turns of two or three notes, written here as plain eighths); whether the first held G of the first pass (0:08, four seconds) is a G or a high F sharp; every note length.
